How about adding the infamous ring of extra ring finger?  They would
come with pluses and minuses, so:

-1 - Usually cursed.  Putting it on immediately pushes off any
     ring on the other hand and doesn't permit it to be put back on.
     Alternately, it could constrict, chopping off your finger (in,
     say, a turn) permanently lowering your dex by 1 (i.e. restore
     ability won't work).

+0 - Usually cursed.  Takes up the space of a finger.  No other action.

+1 - Allows 2 rings to be worn along with it.  In essence, null
     effect.

+2 and above - Gives you this many extra spaces for rings.

The numbering scheme isn't quite perfect.  I would tend to think a +1
ring should have more effect than nothing.


